{"User-supplied URL used directly in href with target=\"_blank\" without rel=\"noopener\" or rel=\"noreferrer\", enabling reverse tabnabbing attacks where the opened page can access window.opener and navigate the original site to a phishing page": 0.7229753732681274, "User-supplied URL in href lacks scheme validation, allowing javascript: or data: URIs that can execute arbitrary script when clicked": 0.5718553066253662, "New attribute :website_name is exposed in user serializer but not included in untrusted_attributes list, causing privacy leak where website information is visible to viewers who were previously prevented from seeing the :website field": 0.08563214540481567, "Frontend/backend naming mismatch: template references model.website_name (snake_case) but Ember typically uses camelCase property names, potentially causing undefined or blank values if attribute transforms are in place": 0.2086055874824524}